    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>He wore the same faded Rose Flow shirt to most of his gigs.</li>
      <li>He would tend to leave long voicemails instead of texting.</li>
      <li>Despite everything, there are a few people who still think he was some kind of legend.</li>
      <li>His coffee cup was practically glued to his hand; he'd refill it so often that Jesper joked it was a part of him.</li>
      <li>He insisted VHS tapes had a soul that digital media could never capture, often defending the format in arguments long after it was deemed obsolete.</li>
      <li>Even when broke, he always found ways to afford blank tapes. They were the one thing he'd never cut from his budget.</li>
      <li>His handwriting was almost illegible, often leaving people to guess what tape labels were supposed to say.</li>
      <li>Some of his old recordings feature himself talking directly to the camera, venting frustrations he never said out loud to family or friends.</li>
    </ul>
